    A monster 2 levels higher than itself
    Another pet
    Cockatrices or chickatrices unless stoning resistant
    Quest Leader or guardians
    Peaceful monsters when the pet is at less then 25% HP
    Monsters that that have some sort of defensive reaction that deals
damage (things like blue     jelly, acid blobs, and gas spores), if the
